  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP is committed to supporting national efforts to address the pressing human rights challenges and support the Republic of Moldova to reach its human rights obligations. This intervention aims at laying the foundation for a strategic engagement in the area of human rights implementation that responds to immediate needs and also addresses longer-term aspirations of the Peoples Advocate Office, and will be summarized in the Project document that will be prepared at the end of the Initiation Pla</narrative>
